rl":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2022-08-29T13:46:24Z","updated_at":"2022-10-10T01:53:39Z","closed_at":"2022-09-19T18:54:05Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-3312](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-3312)\r\n### Description\n\nWhen connecting to `template1` database after cluster startup, only the first connection would go through. All subsequent would crash:\r\n```\r\n$ ./ysqlsh -h localhost template1\r\nysqlsh (11.2-YB-2.15.3.0-b0)\r\nType \"help\" for help.\r\n\r\ntemplate1=#^D\\q\r\n\r\n$ ./ysqlsh -h localhost template1\r\nysqlsh: server closed the connection unexpectedly\r\n\tThis probably means the server terminated abnormally\r\n\tbefore or while processing the request.\r\n```\r\nLogs:\r\n```\r\nF0829 18:39:21.803912 95651200 pg_sys_table_prefetcher.cc:349] Sys table prefetching is enabled but requested table { database_oid: 1 object_oid: 1259 } was not registered. The list of tables ready for prefetching is: []\r\nFatal failure details written to /Users/fs/yugabyte-data/node-1/disk-1/yb-data/tserver/logs/yb-tserver.FATAL.details.2022-08-29T18_39_21.pid36047.txt\r\n```\r\nThis is related to the fact that `global/pg_internal.init` file is not available for the first run so the full preload is executed, and this snippet in `relcache.c`:\r\n```c\r\n\t/*\r\n\t * During initdb also preload catalog caches (not just relation cache) as\r\n\t * they will be used heavily.\r\n\t */\r\n\tif (IsYugaByteEnabled() && YBIsPreparingTemplates())\r\n\t\tYBPreloadCatalogCaches();\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"frozenspider","id":2077017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzcwMTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2077017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider","html_url":"https://github.com/frozenspider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/13796/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/13796/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}